Package: rsrb-neofetch
Version: 1.0.1
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Syntax-XXX <Syntax-XXX@users.noreply.github.com>
Depends: neofetch
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/Syntax-XXX/rsrb
Description: RSRB neofetch preset (RackStation ReBoot logo)
 Makes neofetch show the RSRB logo and NAS-relevant info (volumes,
 local IP). Your own ~/.config/neofetch/config.conf still wins.
 Also provides the rsrbfetch command.
